---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
	title="Infinitix — The round that never stops"
	description="Infinitix is an arcade survival shooter: survive rounds, get stronger, the demons keep escalating. No network, no purchases, no accounts."
	lang="en"
	altHref={`${base}/`}
>
	<Header lang="en" esHref={`${base}/`} enHref={`${base}/en/`} />

	<main>
		<section class="hero">
			<h1>INFINITIX</h1>
			<p class="tagline">The round that never stops</p>
			<p class="premise">
				There's no story that ends, because the round doesn't end. You step into the
				arena, the demons keep escalating, and the only way out is to survive one more —
				and then another. Infinitix is that "one more" turned into a game: every round
				makes you stronger, every round sends something worse after you, and there's no
				happy ending waiting on the other side. Just the next high score.
			</p>
			<a class="cta" href="#" aria-disabled="true">Coming soon to Google Play</a>
		</section>

		<section class="features">
			<div class="feature">
				<h2>Auto-fire</h2>
				<p>Move with the joystick, your ship fires automatically at the nearest enemy.
				All your attention goes to dodging, not aiming.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="feature">
				<h2>Every round, stronger</h2>
				<p>Level up mid-run and pick upgrades: fire rate, range, damage, new abilities.
				Every run builds a different loadout.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="feature">
				<h2>Pick your pilot</h2>
				<p>A roster of characters with their own perks — and the option to create your
				own with your own photo, always saved on your device.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<Footer lang="en" />
</Base>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding-top: 64px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 8vw, 4rem);
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--cyan);
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(125, 253, 254, 0.35);
	}

	.tagline {
		color: var(--magenta);
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-top: 6px;
	}

	.premise {
		max-width: 560px;
		margin: 24px auto 0;
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.cta {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 32px;
		padding: 14px 28px;
		border-radius: 10px;
		border: 2px solid var(--cyan);
		color: var(--cyan);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 700;
		opacity: 0.85;
		cursor: default;
	}

	.features {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 24px;
		margin-top: 72px;
	}

	.feature {
		background: var(--panel);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 20px;
	}

	.feature h2 {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--cyan);
		margin: 0 0 8px;
	}

	.feature p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}
</style>
